   "module_16049493631818": {
    "body": {
     "hs_enable_module_padding": true,
     "hs_wrapper_css": {
      "padding-bottom": "20px",
      "padding-left": "20px",
      "padding-right": "20px",
      "padding-top": "25px"
     },
     "html": "<p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-weight: normal; color: #000000;\">Hi {{ contact.firstname }},</span></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-size: 15px; line-height: 150%; text-align: left;\">You showed interest in our private label program recently.<br><br></p>\n<p>That tells me you're thinking bigger about your brand.<br><br></p>\n<p>You may have grabbed our Private Label Guide already. If you did, great\u2014keep it handy. But I want to make sure you have it in case it got buried in your inbox or you decided to come back to it later. -&gt; <span style=\"color: #6ca439;\"><a href=\"https://f.hubspotusercontent30.net/hubfs/4087538/Download%20Offers/Private%20Label%20Supplements%20Guide/DaVinci-Laboratories-Private-Label-Guide.pdf?__hstc=188311479.1aea57090ed0f264ae70825d79321e7c.1634762496996.1635978029454.1636666277608.11&amp;__hssc=188311479.2.1636666277608&amp;__hsfp=1032815725&amp;hsCtaTracking=5d9f8ac4-6537-4b72-8388-bf1635bb8978%7Ca3311ac4-2719-48ef-b371-56affa0ba28a\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; color: #6ca439;\" rel=\"noopener\">definitive guide to private labeling supplements!</a><br><br></span></p>\n<p>Here's why it matters: Most people launching private label supplements are flying blind. They don't know what actually costs money, how long manufacturing takes, or what separates a formulation that works from one that just looks good on paper.</p>\n<p>Our guide walks you through all of it. The&nbsp;costs. The timeline reality. The formulations that are already moving for clinics and DTC brands. The questions you should ask before signing anything.<br><br></p>\n<p><strong>Inside you'll find:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Best-selling formulations designed for what the market is actually buying right now (not what was hot three years ago)</li>\n<li>How to avoid the MOQ trap that stops most startups cold</li>\n<li>What quality control actually means\u2014and why it matters to your bottom line</li>\n<li>Speed-to-market strategies so you're not waiting six months to launch</li>\n<li>The compliance checklist every brand needs before their first order ships</li>\n</ul>",
     "module_id": 1155639
    },
