      "padding-top": "10px"
     },
     "html": "<p><span style=\"background:#FFF3CD;border-bottom:2px solid #8A6300;\" data-praxera-review=\"brand\">Praxera</span> has been doing this for brands at every stage\u2014first product, scaling their fifth line, niche positioning. <span style=\"background:#F8DDD9;border-bottom:2px solid #9B3B31;\" data-praxera-review=\"claim\">We handle</span> the manufacturing complexity. You handle building your brand. <span style=\"color: #6ca439; font-weight: normal;\"><a href=\"https://f.hubspotusercontent30.net/hubfs/4087538/Download%20Offers/Private%20Label%20Supplements%20Guide/DaVinci-Laboratories-Private-Label-Guide.pdf?__hstc=188311479.1aea57090ed0f264ae70825d79321e7c.1634762496996.1635978029454.1636666277608.11&amp;__hssc=188311479.2.1636666277608&amp;__hsfp=1032815725&amp;hsCtaTracking=5d9f8ac4-6537-4b72-8388-bf1635bb8978%7Ca3311ac4-2719-48ef-b371-56affa0ba28a\" style=\"color: #6ca439; font-weight: bold;\" rel=\"noopener\">\u2192 Download the Guide (or grab it again if you need a refresh)</a></span></p>",
